Since https://github.com/libuv/libuv/commit/40d45efebf9bf1a8091a573d26e53d9c4262ef5b (1.53.0) posix_spawn()
is used on every Unix. It does not exist before 10.5, and
POSIX_SPAWN_CLOEXEC_DEFAULT / posix_spawn_file_actions_addinherit_np() do not
exist before 10.7: use fork() on 10.4, and on 10.5-10.6 take the generic
non-Apple posix_spawn() path (fd shuffle + cloexec_lock).
